<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@/~cl_11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@/~cl_11> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 17 the following section: \"Power to establish companies 17A. The Corporation may, from time to time, with the approval of the Minister and the concurrence of the Minister of Finance, establish companies by such names as the Corporation may determine to carry out and have the charge, conduct and management on behalf of the Corporation of any project, scheme or enterprise determined by the Corporation in the discharge of its functions and the exercise of its powers.\". Amendment of section 18"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@/~cl_12> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@> .
