<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Small and Medium Industries Development Corporation (Amendment) Act 2009."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/10/eng@> .
